// chriz-iwd-encounters 360: Poquelin has jumped (CIE_POQ_WAVE 1, set by his script):
// the pause before the next of his five waves ends now (on top of the cave's area
// script). Only between waves (FLUSH_SPAWNS 0) and while waves are left (TRAP_PHASE
// 1-4); in a spawn window it waits for the pause. CIE_POQ_WAVE (area): 2 done.

IF
  Global("CIE_POQ_WAVE","MYAREA",1)
  Global("FLUSH_SPAWNS","MYAREA",0)
  GlobalGT("TRAP_PHASE","MYAREA",0)
  GlobalLT("TRAP_PHASE","MYAREA",5)
THEN
  RESPONSE #100
    SetGlobal("CIE_POQ_WAVE","MYAREA",2)
    SetGlobalTimer("SPAWN_TIMER","MYAREA",0)
    Continue()
END
